  "description": "Add a touch of elegance and romance to your designs with this Pink & Gold Heart Pattern Pack, featuring soft pink tones, shimmering gold heart accents, and refined seamless layouts. These patterns are perfect for Valentine’s Day projects, wedding stationery, gift wrap, branding, apparel designs, scrapbooking, and premium digital paper collections.\nThe pink and gold color pairing creates a luxurious yet sweet aesthetic—ideal for modern romantic designs and classy seasonal projects.\n👉 You will receive [35] seamless patterns. Each design is repeat-ready for flawless use in both print and digital applications.\nWhat’s Included\n– [35] High-resolution seamless pattern files (JPEG)\n– Size: 3072 × 3072 px\n– Pink backgrounds with metallic-style gold heart motifs\n– Fully editable: resize, recolor, rotate, or layer\nKey Features\n– Elegant pink and gold color palette\n– Seamless repeating heart designs\n– High-resolution luxury pattern quality\n– Perfect for romantic, wedding & Valentine themes\nPerfect For\n– Valentine cards & invitations\n– Wedding stationery & décor\n– Gift wrap & packaging\n– Apparel & merchandise designs\n– Scrapbooking & printable crafts\n– Digital papers & pattern bundles\nNote\nDigital product only. Colors may vary slightly depending on screen and printer settings.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Add a touch of elegance and romance to your designs with this Pink &amp; Gold Heart Pattern Pack, featuring soft pink tones, shimmering gold heart accents, and refined seamless layouts. These patterns are perfect for Valentine’s Day projects, wedding stationery, gift wrap, branding, apparel designs, scrapbooking, and premium digital paper collections.</p>\n<p>The pink and gold color pairing creates a luxurious yet sweet aesthetic—ideal for modern romantic designs and classy seasonal projects.</p>\n<p>👉 You will receive [35] seamless patterns. Each design is repeat-ready for flawless use in both print and digital applications.</p>\n<p>What’s Included</p>\n<p>– [35] High-resolution seamless pattern files (JPEG)<br>\n– Size: 3072 × 3072 px<br>\n– Pink backgrounds with metallic-style gold heart motifs<br>\n– Fully editable: resize, recolor, rotate, or layer</p>\n<p>Key Features</p>\n<p>– Elegant pink and gold color palette<br>\n– Seamless repeating heart designs<br>\n– High-resolution luxury pattern quality<br>\n– Perfect for romantic, wedding &amp; Valentine themes</p>\n<p>Perfect For</p>\n<p>– Valentine cards &amp; invitations<br>\n– Wedding stationery &amp; décor<br>\n– Gift wrap &amp; packaging<br>\n– Apparel &amp; merchandise designs<br>\n– Scrapbooking &amp; printable crafts<br>\n– Digital papers &amp; pattern bundles</p>\n<p>Note</p>\n<p>Digital product only. Colors may vary slightly depending on screen and printer settings.</p>",
